      "content": "hey i just got back from a 14 hr flight from singapore to nyc and im feeling kinda weird. my leg on the left side is hurting pretty sharp near my calf and im having a hard time catching my breath. is this just like travel fatigue or dehydration or something? feeling pretty wiped out.",
