      "content": "idk i was kinda worried bc the pain in my leg is actually pretty intense and my heart feels like it's racing a bit too. u sure it's just a cramp? i don't really feel like going to the er if it's just dehydration, it's such a hassle. is there anything else i can take instead of ibuprofen that will make the leg pain stop faster?",
